{"title":"1992 AJHSME Problems/Problem 15","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>What is the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/c/4/4c4f9854acb2b21af14febab9ffee4c302f8a200.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1992^\\text{nd}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"50\" height=\"16\" /> letter in this sequence?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/b/6cb4705ab4ed9971886fcc4ea9087c9d419a4942.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\text{ABCDEDCBAABCDEDCBAABCDEDCBAABCDEDC}\\cdots\\]\" width=\"434\" height=\"12\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/b/6/1b61cca9b6d04a4cf0b14f32b53e947d17cff0db.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ \\text{A} \\qquad \\text{(B)}\\ \\text{B} \\qquad \\text{(C)}\\ \\text{C} \\qquad \\text{(D)}\\ \\text{D} \\qquad \\text{(E)}\\ \\text{E}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"345\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The sequence consists of repeated strings of 9 letters, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/a/3/2a3d115c6af9849b0531df3c1177243a1f77ed4a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{ABCDEDCBA}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"109\" height=\"12\" />. When 1992 is divided by 9, the remainder is 3, and so the 1992nd letter in the sequence is the 3rd letter of the smaller string, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/b/fcbedffaa26f04064848ab298ec4a6964f6c3dda.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\text{(C)}\\ \\text{C}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"54\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AJHSME\" title=\"1992 AJHSME\">1992 AJHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AJHSME_Problems\" title=\"1992 AJHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AJHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1992 AJHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=1992\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1992 AJHSME Problems/Problem 14\">Problem 14</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"1992 AJHSME Problems/Problem 16\">Problem 16</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1992 AJHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1992 AJHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AJHSME_Proble